WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.900
Welcome to DBL Group's TalentHub!
From the moment a requisition

2
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:09.480
reaches you to the day a new colleague
joins, it is all the recruiter's work.

3
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.840
In this video: publishing the job
and collecting CVs,

4
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:18.480
assessing and interviewing candidates,
and onboarding. Let's get started!

5
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:23.937
The Dashboard's Recruitment you're
running lists your requisitions.

6
00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:27.910
Open one and there are five tabs,
which is also this video's order:

7
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:33.550
Profile & Posting, Recruitment,
Assessment, Interviews, Onboarding.

8
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:40.020
The role is group-wide, granted on Access
Control. But you see a requisition only

9
00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:45.140
once it is assigned to you, or you
are covering for a colleague on leave.

10
00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:49.540
The menu has Requisitions,
Candidates, Talent Bank,

11
00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:53.740
My Interviews, and in your own
menu beside the bell, availability.

12
00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:56.610
The first tab, Profile & Posting.

13
00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:01.426
Once the requisition is Approved,
a role profile is already drafted

14
00:01:01.546 --> 00:01:06.090
from Factory HR's job analysis:
responsibilities, requirements.

15
00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:08.480
Use this profile keeps it as is,

16
00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:13.440
Regenerate has the AI write it afresh,
Write manually lets you write it yourself.

17
00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.840
Save profile,
and the status is Profile Ready.

18
00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.984
Set the closing date, Publish job posting.

19
00:01:20.104 --> 00:01:24.590
Status Posted, the post is
on DBL's careers page, and

20
00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:31.110
this requisition's folders are created in
Google Drive, where the CVs will be filed.

21
00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.780
Share job link to send the link.

22
00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:39.302
Social post gives a ready Facebook post.
And Post to BDJobs posts

23
00:01:39.422 --> 00:01:44.100
it to BDJobs in one click; their shortlist
arrives straight in your pipeline.

24
00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:48.090
The second tab,
Recruitment, your pipeline.

25
00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:50.230
CVs arrive several ways.

26
00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:54.570
From the careers page,
when candidates apply themselves.

27
00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:59.330
From BDJobs, where the row carries
both the BDJobs CV and the Personal CV.

28
00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:03.600
Sent by Factory HR,
the row says Factory HR and their name.

29
00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:07.380
CVs emailed to the
recruitment inbox with the

30
00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:11.600
REQ code in the subject are imported
by themselves within fifteen minutes.

31
00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:14.950
And CVs in hand, Add candidates.

32
00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:21.252
Drop PDFs, up to thirty, names from
the files. The Source is required.

33
00:02:21.372 --> 00:02:25.830
Employee Referral asks who referred.
No CV?

34
00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:31.630
No CV yet, add by name.
Notes for anything you want to remember.

35
00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:35.060
Every CV is read by the
AI on arrival: email,

36
00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:38.500
mobile, a headline,
and a summary. How many

37
00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:43.740
times they applied before shows beside
Applied, matched on email or mobile.

38
00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:48.423
The pipeline's stages: Applied,
AI Shortlisted, Shortlisted,

39
00:02:48.543 --> 00:02:52.810
Interview, Final, Selected,
Rejected. A card shows the name,

40
00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:58.610
Male or Female, the headline,
the source, the AI's one-line summary,

41
00:02:58.730 --> 00:03:03.370
and on the right the match score
and the stage control.

42
00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:06.640
Beside the score, Why with the number.

43
00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:12.640
Click it for every requirement of the
role profile: Met, Partly met, or Gap.

44
00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.560
The AI's view; the decision is yours.

45
00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:18.083
From the stage control, Shortlisted.

46
00:03:18.203 --> 00:03:23.749
In Drive the CV moves itself
to the Shortlisted folder.

47
00:03:23.869 --> 00:03:26.630
Timeline shows the
candidate's whole history.

48
00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:31.700
The toolbar's AI Screen
rescores everyone's CV.

49
00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:35.502
Once everyone has a score,
a Bulk Reject button appears here too,

50
00:03:35.622 --> 00:03:39.502
to reject everyone below
a chosen score in one go.

51
00:03:39.622 --> 00:03:43.668
And in AI Compare, tick two candidates
and compare them side by side.

52
00:03:44.018 --> 00:03:47.818
The third tab, Assessment.
Interview committee:

53
00:03:47.938 --> 00:03:51.938
this post's standing panel,
offered on every scheduling form.

54
00:03:52.288 --> 00:03:58.088
Pre-Interview Screening Tests. Written
and Computer tests are marked by hand:

55
00:03:58.208 --> 00:04:03.688
enable, total and obtained. More than
the total is refused on the spot.

56
00:04:03.808 --> 00:04:07.968
Pass marks live in AI Settings.

57
00:04:08.318 --> 00:04:11.158
If the answer sheet is scanned,
attach the PDF;

58
00:04:11.278 --> 00:04:14.678
it files under Interview Docs.

59
00:04:14.798 --> 00:04:19.320
And a mark Factory HR entered is
locked for them; if it is wrong,

60
00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:23.038
you or Head of Talent
Acquisition correct it.

61
00:04:23.388 --> 00:04:26.868
The AI Proficiency Test
is run by the system.

62
00:04:26.988 --> 00:04:31.144
Assign: grade, question count, time limit.

63
00:04:31.264 --> 00:04:36.828
Email each candidate their test link. The
result lands on the scorecard by itself.

64
00:04:37.178 --> 00:04:40.328
The Candidate scorecard has everything:
test marks, each round's

65
00:04:40.448 --> 00:04:45.738
panel marks and recommendations, and
on request the AI's evaluation summary.

66
00:04:46.088 --> 00:04:52.208
The fourth tab, Interviews. The first
interview often happens at the factory.

67
00:04:52.328 --> 00:04:58.688
Send for interview: pick the Factory HR,
which tests, a note.

68
00:04:58.808 --> 00:05:01.487
The candidate appears on
their Assigned Candidates.

69
00:05:01.837 --> 00:05:05.957
Now notice: the row says Held by with
the name, and your buttons are gone.

70
00:05:06.077 --> 00:05:11.077
The round is theirs;
you see everything and change nothing.

71
00:05:11.784 --> 00:05:14.428
To take it back, Withdraw, with a record.

72
00:05:14.778 --> 00:05:18.178
The Interviews tab is in two parts.

73
00:05:18.298 --> 00:05:23.818
Ready, decided by the factory or your own.
Other, still with the factory.

74
00:05:24.168 --> 00:05:28.368
On Ready, Schedule interview.
The round: Second or Final.

75
00:05:28.488 --> 00:05:33.488
Dhaka time, GMT+6.
Online makes a Meet link by itself.

76
00:05:33.608 --> 00:05:37.208
In person, a Location and room.

77
00:05:37.558 --> 00:05:41.518
The panel: From HR Department,
From other departments. Below,

78
00:05:42.358 --> 00:05:48.460
who hears: Google Calendar and Email
for the Candidate, Notify for the Panel.

79
00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:53.558
Schedule. Every panelist
gets a personal marking link.

80
00:05:53.908 --> 00:05:56.652
On the round's card:
Did this interview happen,

81
00:05:56.772 --> 00:06:02.028
Interviewed or Did not attend.
Reschedule, a new time and a reason.

82
00:06:02.148 --> 00:06:07.588
Copy link, New link if someone
loses theirs. Add interviewer.

83
00:06:07.938 --> 00:06:13.578
Once marks arrive, they are on the card:
each panelist's marks and recommendation,

84
00:06:13.698 --> 00:06:19.618
Select, Reject or Talent Pool.
AI Evaluation Summary sums it all up.

85
00:06:19.968 --> 00:06:25.211
Many in one day?
Schedule Interview Day on the toolbar:

86
00:06:25.331 --> 00:06:28.250
the date, the start,
the length of each, the panel once;

87
00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:31.888
candidates get consecutive slots,
each their own email.

88
00:06:32.238 --> 00:06:35.078
Now the salary. Fix salary.

89
00:06:35.998 --> 00:06:39.598
On the left the proposed gross
and the progress; on the right the steps:

90
00:06:39.718 --> 00:06:45.358
grade, whether the screening tests
were passed, the committee average.

91
00:06:45.708 --> 00:06:48.228
The band ladder turns
the average into a band.

92
00:06:49.148 --> 00:06:53.766
Negotiation holds what the candidate said:
present salary, expected, benefits.

93
00:06:53.886 --> 00:06:56.668
The proposed gross,
with an override if you need one.

94
00:06:57.018 --> 00:07:02.418
Offer figure, the number told
to the candidate. Finalize,

95
00:07:02.538 --> 00:07:08.218
and the salary is fixed.
Remember, any later edit reopens it.

96
00:07:08.568 --> 00:07:12.768
Mark as selected.
Without a fixed salary it refuses

97
00:07:12.888 --> 00:07:17.701
and offers Fix salary, because the
board approves with the salary.

98
00:07:17.821 --> 00:07:20.808
Fixed, and the candidate is Selected.

99
00:07:21.368 --> 00:07:24.808
And Reject, with a reason
and the regret-mail tick.

100
00:07:25.158 --> 00:07:30.238
The fifth tab, Onboarding.
Click Onboard and the workspace opens,

101
00:07:30.358 --> 00:07:35.918
six steps: documents, facilities,
medical, board, offer, final.

102
00:07:36.038 --> 00:07:39.199
The order is deliberate;
the offer comes last.

103
00:07:39.668 --> 00:07:45.748
Step one. Start onboarding, then Email
link, and the candidate gets their portal.

104
00:07:45.868 --> 00:07:51.090
The checklist has every document:
photographs, academic, professional,

105
00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:55.508
experience, identity,
financial, signature.

106
00:07:55.858 --> 00:08:00.378
As documents arrive, Verify
or Reject each, with the AI's summary.

107
00:08:01.218 --> 00:08:04.246
Cross-check has the AI compare
the documents with the CV.

108
00:08:04.366 --> 00:08:07.778
Chase documents emails
for what is missing.

109
00:08:08.128 --> 00:08:12.544
The four NID particulars are typed;
they print on the appointment letter.

110
00:08:12.664 --> 00:08:17.288
Reference checks,
one form per referee with your signature,

111
00:08:17.408 --> 00:08:23.248
the AI drafts the comment.
Papers in hand, Checked by Manual on hand.

112
00:08:23.598 --> 00:08:27.566
Step two, facilities,
what the requisition asked for,

113
00:08:27.686 --> 00:08:30.998
with the transport and dormitory caveats.

114
00:08:31.118 --> 00:08:37.118
Mark as Reviewed, even when there
is nothing, or medical stays locked.

115
00:08:37.468 --> 00:08:42.708
Step three, Request medical test:
which tests, the salutation,

116
00:08:42.908 --> 00:08:47.668
the reference number. You do not set the
date; Head of Talent Acquisition does.

117
00:08:48.028 --> 00:08:53.308
The Medical Officer writes the report, the
CMO confirms, and then Medical cleared.

118
00:08:53.658 --> 00:08:58.418
Step four, Send for Board Approval.
You name nobody;

119
00:08:58.538 --> 00:09:03.538
Head of Talent Acquisition builds
the sheet and sends it to the CHRO

120
00:09:03.658 --> 00:09:06.133
and the board.
The sheet's progress shows here.

121
00:09:06.483 --> 00:09:10.522
Step five, the offer.
Junior or senior format,

122
00:09:10.642 --> 00:09:14.948
who signs from the CHRO holders,
the joining date.

123
00:09:15.068 --> 00:09:18.963
Preview shows the letter on DBL's pad.
Send.

124
00:09:19.313 --> 00:09:23.993
When the candidate accepts on the portal,
the counter-signed copy is filed by

125
00:09:24.113 --> 00:09:26.113
itself. A decline shows its reason here.

126
00:09:26.233 --> 00:09:32.433
Facility requests go to Admin or IT,
who click Confirm arranged.

127
00:09:32.783 --> 00:09:37.903
Step six. Placement: the employee ID
and the line manager from the directory.

128
00:09:38.023 --> 00:09:42.396
Send the Code of Conduct;
the candidate signs it on the portal.

129
00:09:42.516 --> 00:09:47.623
Final verification:
documents verified, medical cleared,

130
00:09:47.743 --> 00:09:53.103
one reference check, the four NID
particulars; whatever is missing is named.

131
00:09:53.453 --> 00:09:57.898
Notify IT. On the left the form:
the preferred email address, platform,

132
00:09:58.018 --> 00:10:03.013
purpose, Add on CC, and for a
replacement the leaver's email to delete.

133
00:10:03.133 --> 00:10:06.613
On the right, the email as
IT will get it. Send to IT.

134
00:10:06.733 --> 00:10:09.983
When IT reports the created address
through their link, Onboarded.

135
00:10:10.283 --> 00:10:16.533
The appointment letter, preview and send.
Print the full record, or the one-page

136
00:10:16.653 --> 00:10:20.843
summary. Archive puts every document
in the candidate's Drive folder.

137
00:10:21.193 --> 00:10:26.385
A few small things.
The regret mail never goes by itself,

138
00:10:26.505 --> 00:10:32.506
only when you send it, once,
and the card says so afterwards.

139
00:10:32.856 --> 00:10:37.776
Talent Bank: reaching Final or Selected
adds a candidate here by itself;

140
00:10:37.896 --> 00:10:43.016
starting onboarding removes them.
Search, Add to Requisition Pipeline.

141
00:10:43.366 --> 00:10:48.646
Leave. Your own menu beside the bell,
Availability,

142
00:10:48.766 --> 00:10:52.926
pick the days, and for each requisition
who covers, here Mehedi Hasan.

143
00:10:53.046 --> 00:10:56.553
Confirm leave.

144
00:10:56.673 --> 00:11:00.966
Both of you can act; the cover lapses
when the leave ends or on I'm back.

145
00:11:01.316 --> 00:11:06.876
You are told when: a requisition
is assigned, Factory HR sends CVs,

146
00:11:07.156 --> 00:11:10.610
someone leaves the test window,
the factory's verdict arrives,

147
00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:16.077
a sheet is decided, medical is cleared,
an offer is accepted,

148
00:11:16.437 --> 00:11:19.476
a facility is arranged,
IT creates the email.

149
00:11:19.826 --> 00:11:23.226
Questions. Mark as selected not working?

150
00:11:23.346 --> 00:11:27.242
The salary is not fixed.
Cannot change an interview?

151
00:11:27.362 --> 00:11:31.786
Check Held by; it is with the factory.

152
00:11:31.906 --> 00:11:36.506
Why does a BDJobs candidate
arrive at Shortlisted?

153
00:11:36.626 --> 00:11:39.318
BDJobs sends its own shortlist,
that is why.

154
00:11:39.668 --> 00:11:45.308
In short: profile, posting,
CVs, tests, interviews, salary,

155
00:11:45.428 --> 00:11:51.748
then onboarding. The full guide is
a PDF under Tutorials. Thank you.

